'''Flaxwhisker Front''' is an [[Alliance]]-aligned outpost located in southern [[Azshara]]. It is a basecamp established by a gnomish expedition sent from [[Gnomeregan]] before it was lost, now left stranded and unaware of the tragedy that befell their home.<ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/20260514170802/https://turtlecraft.gg/new-locations-and-maps New Zones & World Edits]. Archived from [https://turtlecraft.gg/new-locations-and-maps the original] on 2026-05-14. Retrieved on 2026-29-08.</ref>

